{"id":"37a053154986e417","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-theory-strength.md","title":"TB与UTB的算术强度相同","display":"cor-truth-theory-strength — TB与UTB的算术强度相同","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-theory-strength","aliases":["91-cor-truth-theory-strength"],"display":"cor-truth-theory-strength — TB与UTB的算术强度相同","depends_on":["[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-theory-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-theory-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-theory-strength — TB与UTB的算术强度相同"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-truth-theory-strength-—-TB-与-UTB-的算术强度相同\">cor-truth-theory-strength — TB 与 UTB 的算术强度相同</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span> (分别采用逐句与一致形式去引号公理的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (共同基础算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T,\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T,\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>-保守扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保守性对所有算术句成立，因而特别对通常指全称算术句类的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>\n成立。于是 TB 与 UTB 不可能在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果上形成严格强度关系。</p>\n<p>UTB 的一致参数模式在含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的语言里比 TB 更便于表达统一去引号，\n但这种表达优势不等于产生新的算术定理。若加入含真理谓词的归纳或\n反思原则，必须把得到的新理论另行标明后再比较。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-truth-theory-strength-—-TB-与-UTB-的算术强度相同","text":"cor-truth-theory-strength — TB 与 UTB 的算术强度相同","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T,\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\Pi_1}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1489,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["7e76f1ecb9ab7743","4a1d989a5f615933"]}